WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.563
In two minutes, you will have a live neighborhood contest, with its own link and QR code.

00:00:05.563 --> 00:00:06.252
Let's start.

00:00:07.155 --> 00:00:10.487
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.767
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:17.257
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:17.257 --> 00:00:18.603
Tap Use my location.

00:00:20.345 --> 00:00:22.561
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.561 --> 00:00:23.213
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.515 --> 00:00:27.258
The map zooms to where you are.

00:00:27.258 --> 00:00:31.343
There are no events on your street, so tap Show all of Southern California.

00:00:33.012 --> 00:00:38.155
Now every place shows how far away it is, nearest first, so you can plan your drive.

00:00:39.054 --> 00:00:41.550
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.767
See the three dots?

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:43.315
Tap them.

00:00:44.918 --> 00:00:46.497
In the menu, tap Add.

00:00:48.258 --> 00:00:49.441
Three choices.

00:00:49.441 --> 00:00:50.545
Tap A contest.

00:00:52.381 --> 00:00:53.657
Name your contest.

00:00:53.657 --> 00:00:55.470
Type a name, then tap Next.

00:00:58.409 --> 00:00:59.550
Who is running it?

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:02.252
Type the name, pick your city, then tap Next.

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:07.892
This welcome message is already written.

00:01:07.892 --> 00:01:09.274
Keep it, and tap Next.

00:01:11.077 --> 00:01:12.804
A website is optional.

00:01:12.804 --> 00:01:14.455
Skip it, and tap Next.

00:01:16.377 --> 00:01:18.667
These dates are filled in for you.

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:19.256
Tap Next.

00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:22.640
Choose Quick start.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:24.672
It sets everything up for you.

00:01:24.672 --> 00:01:25.590
Then tap Next.

00:01:28.201 --> 00:01:30.941
Check your details, and tap Create contest.

00:01:33.504 --> 00:01:35.153
Your contest is live!

00:01:35.153 --> 00:01:36.802
Tap Open my dashboard.

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:43.117
This is your dashboard, with your link and QR code, ready to share.

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:47.327
Next up: Create a contest with Customize.
